{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117020","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117020/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117020/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117020/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117020","id":4016583875,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HmnNP","number":117020,"title":"Add filter input to `PopupMenu`","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-03T13:07:12Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T10:16:31Z","closed_at":"2026-03-04T18:22:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117020","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117020","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117020.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117020.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"> [!IMPORTANT]\r\n> I didn't realize when I started working on this for godotengine/godot-proposals#3333 that #114236 was implementing largely the exact same thing already, so I'm mostly just putting this up for reference purposes. See [this comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114236#issuecomment-3990948648) for a more detailed breakdown of the differences.\r\n\r\nThis adds a new `filter_enabled` property to `PopupMenu`, which when enabled will show a `LineEdit` at the top of the popup, which can then be used to filter the items within the popup.\r\n\r\nIt also makes use of the `FuzzySearch` class to make the filtering \"fuzzy\", allowing typos and such.\r\n\r\nIt also adds an API for defining the filtering behavior on a per-item basis, which can be either `FILTER_NORMAL`, `FILTER_ALWAYS_HIDE` or `FILTER_ALWAYS_SHOW`. This allows for forcing certain items to always hide/show itself when there is a filter string.\r\n\r\nI use this in `EditorResourcePicker` to always hide the \"actions\" when filtering, such as \"Load\" and \"Quick Load\", and to always show the \"New\" separator, which ends up looking like this:\r\n\r\n[Recording_20260303_125201.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c3b549b-ddef-42e6-afeb-42c8efad9d5f)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n*Disclaimer: AI tooling was used to a non-trivial degree to plan and produce this change, but in no way was this entirely authored by it. Anything not physically typed out by myself has been carefully reviewed to the best of my ability.*","closed_by":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117020/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":8,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117020/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}